    <statement>
                 <p>Write a function called <c>keywords(soup)</c> that takes a soup object and returns a list of Python keywords.
                    The soup object is created from the file <c>PythonKeywords.html</c> which is a saved version of 
                    <q>https://www.w3schools.com/python/python_ref_keywords.asp</q> from 2026.
                       Click on the following link to view the source: <url href="http://web.archive.org/web/20260723003533/https://www.w3schools.com/python/python_ref_keywords.asp">link</url>.
                    For example, <c>keywords(soup)</c> should return a list that starts with: <c>['and', 'as', ...]</c>.
                 </p>
    </statement>
    <program interactive="activecode" language="python3" add-files="bs-python-keywords-id">
        <code>
from bs4 import BeautifulSoup
import requests

